      "worked": "Choose five people from twelve, then five from the remaining seven. Each group has $4!$ circular arrangements. Interchanging the two circles gives the same seating arrangement, so divide by $2!$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\frac{\\binom{12}{5}\\binom{7}{5}\\times4!\\times4!}{2!}\\\\N&=\\frac{792\\times21\\times24\\times24}{2}\\\\N&=4790016\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
